stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> NotFriends

    state "NotFriends" as NotFriends
    note right of NotFriends
        The two users have no connection or pending requests.
    end note

    state "Pending" as Pending
    note right of Pending
        A friend request has been sent from the requester to the recipient.
        From the requester's view, this is "Request Sent".
        From the recipient's view, this is "Request Received".
    end note

    state "Friends" as Friends
    note right of Friends
        The users are connected as friends.
    end note

    state "Blocked" as Blocked
    note right of Blocked
        One user has blocked the other, preventing any interaction.
    end note

    NotFriends --> Pending: sendRequest()
    Pending --> Friends: acceptRequest()
    Pending --> NotFriends: declineRequest() / cancelRequest()
    Friends --> NotFriends: unfriend()
    Friends --> Blocked: blockUser()
    NotFriends --> Blocked: blockUser()
    Blocked --> NotFriends: unblockUser()
